h the country's garment export to  the US market grew in recent months  things may not remain so rosy if  president Trump's goes ahead with his  plan and impose additional tariffs on  apparel imports Bangladesh already plays  15.3% duties to the US amongst the  highest of any nation sandwich Audrey  al-jazeera  Eshoo Leah Bangladesh
 

